{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"valid\": true,\n  \"entry\": \"左上方大面积、高亮度的白色文字，第一眼落在段落开头“他仍不服气，觉得当初那些气不该忍”这一句；右上角目录和下方音符动画次于文字。\",\n  \"grasp_who\": \"他对过去受过的气仍然不服，觉得当初不应该忍。\",\n  \"grasp_feel\": \"不服气、委屈、恼火。\",\n  \"missed\": \"他如今已经不在那些人身边；过去的美好回忆也变得难以触碰；不服气逐渐消退，但失落和眷恋仍在，内心还有疲惫和不安。\",\n  \"burden\": [\n    \"单块太长，一块里有好几层意思，处境、情绪变化和音乐描述连续展开。\",\n    \"核心感受的变化需要继续读后面的内容才能理解，第一眼容易停留在开头的不服气，无法把握后续的疲惫、失落与眷恋。\"\n  ],\n  \"score\": 2\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "9ef3b8d3-4877-4d09-905a-8d9058e5f620", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261110T015011468303Z", "elapsed_seconds": 29.578, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T01:50:41.048321+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "c3cb8c2e58d86d8633166c61cac521cea1514b4e9e0e55dbfbf648fd69252bbc", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "